. La aplicaci\u00f3n cuenta con una interfaz clara y accesible, f\u00e1cil de navegar con las gafas puestas. Crea, edita y elimina alarmas con gestos sencillos y disfruta de notificaciones visuales y sonoras claras que te garantizan que nunca te pierdas un momento importante, ya sea que est\u00e9s jugando, trabajando o relaj\u00e1ndote en RV.", "short_description": "Esta alarma tiene: Temporizador, Cron\u00f3metro y alarma de conversi\u00f3n."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "portrait.png", "id": "2905496342955542", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507823984_2905496346288875_7146297178865334511_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5VRQydnXlw0Q7kNvwE5SqqU&_nc_oc=AdqWDv1AcjplT-TaJ8sRl3znPNSlLh80gx6qSCf_ZVyg-QAiIvqvtpYNS__cgLE4KFY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2aNVnxoxRHIKdxsY66bZAFzOI7hgZphe-2uzDsTO7PeQ&oe=69E380BE"}, {"file_name": "icono-512.png", "id": "2243906042732063", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618482_2243906046065396_1094352884120925797_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RXRrGVNoGGMQ7kNvwEaxXH0&_nc_oc=AdpOR2i5VsYvfK0FHr_3ebt-YXOsVniO3EbfDrdv8SKr6rVYG1GrxzQccGbNYvBx6Vs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2lMVWZKLveKWRJ1QEqkzhXjdGLRtU90dwowABD8dlqGg&oe=69E3975E"}, {"file_name": "square.png", "id": "1745867016009353", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831056_1745867019342686_1501165532938032609_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Lm-l2WpdV0UQ7kNvwHV7aAN&_nc_oc=Adr7BTa-skVCofbYVL3W2pDbTZ89-NzAa0By_kzv-Y5sJNW2eRcU52kb2uk4mvCEGuc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af36yR6b_3bJ_uAXycx9cyy_HPkfr9NQQBjwIAKLTpzdyQ&oe=69E38CDB"}, {"file_name": "hero cover.png", "id": "1368705761087761", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://sco